    - rid: 141452603536965724
      type: {class: DialogueLineNode, ns: , asm: Assembly-CSharp}
      data:
        nodeID: Argument_Dialogue_P2
        text: <pause=0.5>She was so angry about me 'not paying attention to her and
          only caring about my research'. <shake>Please.</shake> Give me a break.
        nextNodeID: Argument_Dialogue_P3
    - rid: 141452603536965725
      type: {class: DialogueLineNode, ns: , asm: Assembly-CSharp}
      data:
        nodeID: Argument_Dialogue_P3
        text: I do remember us yelling at each other a lot during that fight. I said
          some things that I...<pause=1>really shouldn't have said.
        nextNodeID: Argument_Dialogue_P4
    - rid: 141452603536965726
      type: {class: DialogueLineNode, ns: , asm: Assembly-CSharp}
      data:
        nodeID: Argument_Dialogue_P4
        text: But it's not <shake>my</shake> fault! She was the one who started it!
        nextNodeID: 
    - rid: 7513793525250261082
      type: {class: DialogueLineNode, ns: , asm: Assembly-CSharp}
      data:
        nodeID: Argument_Dialogue_P1
        text: This reminds me of that argument I had with Max before she...<pause=0.5>before
          We broke up...
        nextNodeID: Argument_Dialogue_P2
